 ght-day lab\, 1 to 10 October 2026 (arrival 1 October\, departure 10 Octob
 er)\n\nMore: https://www.ctm-festival.de/activities/resynthesising-the-tra
 ditional/artistic-labs/artistic-labs/open-call-nopa-festival?utm_source=ar
